      "text": "As most of my friends know I eagerly ordered a brand new 2007 Jeep Wrangler Rubicon (4-door model) almost as soon as they were available. I’m proud to say that after almost three years I’ve finally gotten around to giving her the proper upgrades!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "text": "- •3” Teraflex Suspension Lift\n- •Front & Rear Teraflex SpeedBumps\n- •35x12.5” Toyo Open Country M/T Tires\n- •LoD Signature Mid-Width Front Bumper",
